    "sections": {
        "description": "Aurora Lite is a flexible WordPress blog theme built for bloggers, publishers, and content-driven websites. It includes a Default layout for every section of your site, including header, homepage, single post, archives, author, search, and 404 pages, all configurable live in the WordPress Customizer without touching any code. Supports custom colors, Google Fonts, RTL languages, Ajax load more, masonry archives, sidebar control, and WooCommerce. Upgrade to Aurora Pro for 53 layout templates, custom content sections, vertical headers, contact details in header and footer, author social fields, custom JavaScript fields, and 5000+ possible design combinations."
    },
